  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 23831171072
    m_Localized: 'Costume: Full shirt, hat, mask, stethoscope'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123542360064
    m_Localized: Check medical records, ensure correct patient, correct medical orders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151140880384
    m_Localized: Hello. I am nurse Nguyen Van A. Nice to meet you. Today, I will
      change your bandage and clean your wound. Are you ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 178932338688
    m_Localized: Soak gauze in NaCl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 205939462144
    m_Localized: 'Performed in the operating room or patient room.

      Requirements:
      Must be clean, airy, well-lit and convenient for periodic sterilization'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234800467968
    m_Localized: ND "pours" the solution (NaCl, Betadin) into 2 nickel bowls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266823979008
    m_Localized: Clean hands before handling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 295894700032
    m_Localized: After removing the bandage, the nurse assesses and evaluates the
      wound. This is to classify the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339528044544
    m_Localized: Help the patient to a favorable position, exposing the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 400991375360
    m_Localized: The nurse puts on clean gloves and places a pillow under the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426803122176
    m_Localized: Clean hands before handling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 472848191488
    m_Localized: 'Remove the old bandage: Remove slowly and gently.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 508982120448
    m_Localized: 'Continue removing the old bandage: Remove slowly and gently.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 542519775232
    m_Localized: 'Note: If fluid or blood sticks to the bandage, soak it in wound
      cleaning solution (0.9% NaCl) to moisten it before removing to avoid pain and
      bleeding.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 566494416896
    m_Localized: 'Sterile equipment: Tool box (nickel bowl, 2 Kocher forceps, 2 dissecting
      forceps, 1 scissors), gauze, cotton swab

      Clean equipment (on trolley):
      Rectangular tray, scissors, adhesive tape, 2 pairs of gloves (1 clean, 1 sterile),
      cleaning solution (0.9% NaCl), antiseptic solution (Betadin).

      Other
      equipment: Disinfectant solution basin, plastic/mat, medical waste bucket,
      sharps container, quick hand sanitizer bottle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 594940186624
    m_Localized: 'Use gauze soaked in 0.9% NaCl solution.

      Wash from the edge
      of the wound to the outside of the healthy skin and discard.

      Wash from
      the center of the wound to the edge of the wound and discard.

      Note:
      Wash by gently patting, do not rub vigorously.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 623918632960
    m_Localized: Greet, introduce name and title. Inform and explain to the patient
      (and family) about the upcoming procedure to encourage and help them cooperate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644969844736
    m_Localized: Pick up the old gauze on the wound and put it in the dirty laundry
      bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 688280227840
    m_Localized: 'Clean up tools: Arrange neatly, classify waste (tools in disinfectant
      basin, waste in designated bucket).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 715283156992
    m_Localized: Hello. I am nurse Nguyen Van A. Nice to meet you. Today, I will
      change your bandage and clean your wound. Are you ready?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 755837882368
    m_Localized: 'The nurse removes the old gloves, pours the solution (0.9% NaCl
      and Betadin) into the nickel bowl. (Note: Do not let the tip of the solution
      bottle touch the nickel bowl). The nurse disinfects her hands, puts on new
      gloves (sterile).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
